<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Now in night’s darkest hour</l><l>The hope of glory shines,</l><l>Thy Word a lamp in darkness</l><l>Prophetically reminds;</l><l>The sureness of Thy coming</l><l>As dawn’s prevailing ray</l><l>Shines brighter, ever brighter,</l><l>Unto the perfect day.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The echo of the ages</l><l>Doth summon Thy return,</l><l>Reflecting Thine own promise</l><l>From countless hearts that yearn;</l><l>Oh, that Thou wouldst give heed, Lord,</l><l>To our most fervent plea:</l><l>Make haste with Thine appearing</l><l>And take us up to Thee!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>With eyes on the horizon,</l><l>Eastward our hearts incline,</l><l>Still going forth to meet Thee</l><l>Till daybreak’s glimmer shines</l><l>Rise, Morning Star, within us</l><l>Till to the full degree</l><l>We’d be with Thee forever</l><l>In rapturous ecstasy.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
